        <h3>Services Outside of the Clerk's Office</h3>

        <p>The Essex County Clerk is NOT the OPRA Custodian of Records.</p>

        <p>
            Please visit <a href="https://essex.oprarequest.com" target="_blank">essex.oprarequest.com</a>.
        </p>

